   "text": "Current pigment, alpha, atlas dimensions and crop metadata are retained unchanged. Original response recipes were replayed and matched against installed numeric maps before staging. Necessary registered pre-response fields preserve original structure and tissue classification; native stock nodes derive normals, AO, roughness and transmission with visible response controls. No finished numeric response maps are imported. Native default/control and actual model validation remain required; CPU16-bit source quantization is not native execution proof."
