     "title": "Registered original inputs, before response",
     "text": "R original estimated height; G its source-light neighbourhood; B original encoded source luminance; A leaf-tissue selection. These preserve the original resize, alpha registration and FFT neighbourhood where inferring structure from corrected pigment changed the material. Two PNG8 byte planes retain 16-bit source precision. No finished normal, AO, roughness or transmission image is imported. Keep the decoded fields in shader arithmetic; an intermediate half buffer would lose precision.",
     "size": {
      "x": 950,
      "y": 160
     },
